          "text": [
            "cross-ratio of the images =  ((x3-x1)*(x4-x2))/((x3-x2)*(x4-x1))\ncross-ratio of the originals =  ((x3-x1)*(x4-x2))/((x3-x2)*(x4-x1))\ndifference =  0   — invariant ∎\nratio (x3−x1)/(x3−x2) of images vs originals:\n   difference =  ((c*x2-c*x1)*x3-c*x1*x2+c*x1^2)/((c*x1+d)*x3+(-(c*x1)-d)*x2)\n   — nonzero unless c = 0, i.e. unless the map is affine\nfour collinear points, cross-ratio        =  8/5\ntheir images under a general projectivity =  8/5\nimages are still collinear?  true"
          ]
